Description: Places panel and path bar follow the DOT OS design system
 Places rows are text only at 36px, section names are mono capital labels,
 and a device shows a 20-segment capacity meter with its percentage. The
 path bar is set in mono capitals divided by slashes. This affects every
 app that uses the KIO file widgets, including file dialogs. See
 design-system/boards/Files.dc.html.
Author: DOT OS project <maintainers@dot-os.invalid>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-14
---
